{"step_index":2322,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T03:55:56Z","thinking":"**Constructing The Benchmark Harness**\n\nI'm currently focused on designing a calibrated benchmark harness. I'm starting with a hardware stream baseline, specifically `mem_copy_baseline.c`, to measure fundamental memory copy performance. I'm aiming for full physical calibration of this bare-metal suite, to make sure this provides us with a high-fidelity measurement for the target systems.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"// Ground-Truth DRAM Memory Streaming Bandwidth Baseline for Apple Silicon M4\\n#include <stdio.h>\\n#include <stdlib.h>\\n#include <stdint.h>\\n#include <string.h>\\n#include <pthread.h>\\n#include <mach/mach_time.h>\\n#include <arm_neon.h>\\n\\n#define DIM 18432\\n#define TOTAL_VECTORS 100000\\n#define NUM_CORES 10\\n#define ITERATIONS 20\\n\\nstatic double get_time_sec(void) {\\n    static mach_timebase_info_data_t timebase;\\n    if (timebase.denom == 0) {\\n        mach_timebase_info(&timebase);\\n    }\\n    uint64_t time = mach_absolute_time();\\n    return (double)time * timebase.numer / timebase.denom / 1e9;\\n}\\n\\ntypedef struct {\\n    const float *src;\\n    float *dst;\\n    size_t count;\\n} CopyTask;\\n\\nstatic void *copy_worker(void *arg) {\\n    CopyTask *task = (CopyTask *)arg;\\n    size_t num_bytes = task->count * sizeof(float);\\n    memcpy(task->dst, task->src, num_bytes);\\n    return NULL;\\n}\\n\\nint main(void) {\\n    size_t total_floats = (size_t)TOTAL_VECTORS * DIM;\\n    size_t total_bytes = total_floats * sizeof(float);\\n\\n    float *src = (float *)aligned_alloc(64, total_bytes);\\n    float *dst = (float *)aligned_alloc(64, total_bytes);\\n\\n    for (size_t i = 0; i < total_floats; i++) {\\n        src[i] = (float)(i % 100) * 0.001f;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Warmup pass\\n    for (int iter = 0; iter < 5; iter++) {\\n        memcpy(dst, src, total_bytes);\\n    }\\n\\n    pthread_t threads[NUM_CORES];\\n    CopyTask tasks[NUM_CORES];\\n    size_t floats_per_core = total_floats / NUM_CORES;\\n\\n    double t0 = get_time_sec();\\n    for (int iter = 0; iter < ITERATIONS; iter++) {\\n        for (int t = 0; t < NUM_CORES; t++) {\\n            tasks[t].src = src + t * floats_per_core;\\n            tasks[t].dst = dst + t * floats_per_core;\\n            tasks[t].count = (t == NUM_CORES - 1) ? (total_floats - t * floats_per_core) : floats_per_core;\\n            pthread_create(&threads[t], NULL, copy_worker, &tasks[t]);\\n        }\\n        for (int t = 0; t < NUM_CORES; t++) {\\n            pthread_join(threads[t], NULL);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    do\n<truncated 814 bytes>","Description":"\"Ground-truth memory streaming bandwidth baseline for M4 LPDDR5X bus.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/workspaces/multilang_benchmark/mem_copy_baseline.c\"","toolAction":"\"Creating STREAM bandwidth baseline benchmark\"","toolSummary":"\"Write DRAM memory copy baseline\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
